hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1002","Ali bin Hajar, Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala, and Ibn Abdul-Hakam told us, and this is the hadith of Ali, Harmala bin Abdul Aziz told us, On the authority of his uncle, Abdul-Malik ibn al-Rabi’, on the authority of his father, on the authority of his grandfather, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Teach the boy to pray, Ibn Sab’ years, and beat him for it when he is ten years old.”"
